  "question": {
    "text": "The probability that a relation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is both symmetric and transitive, is equal to:",
