  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Total number of elements in the Cartesian product will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>, so total possible relations will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p>The relations which will be symmetric and transitive both will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>&nbsp;i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;relations</p><p>Hence, required probability will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
